---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: News & Blog
description: Professional news, research roundups, and clinical tips for speech-language pathologists.
permalink: /news/
---
<header class="page-header">
  <h1>News &amp; blog</h1>
  <p>Evidence-informed articles for SLP practice — research summaries, caseload wisdom, and free resource guides. Draft posts are marked until editorial review.</p>
</header>

<ul class="post-list">
{%- for post in collections.posts %}
  <li>
    <p class="post-meta">
      <span class="tag">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
      {{ post.date | readableDate }}
      {% if post.data.draft %}<span class="tag">Draft</span>{% endif %}
    </p>
    <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:1.2rem"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-muted);margin:0.4rem 0 0">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
